---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../../../components/Hero.astro";
import Figure from "../../../components/Figure.astro";
import Icon from "../../../components/Icon.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../../consts";
import tshirtImg from "../../../assets/photos/osaka-liberty-walk-tshirt-works-style.jpg";
import heroImg from "../../../assets/photos/osaka-liberty-walk-miniature-f40.jpg";

const shopAddress = "1 Chome-3-13 Kitahorie, Nishi Ward, Osaka 550-0014, Japan";
const mapsHref = `https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=${encodeURIComponent(`Liberty Walk, ${shopAddress}`)}`;
---

<Layout
  title="Liberty Walk Osaka"
  description="The Liberty Walk store in Osaka, not far from Dotonbori: clothing, Osaka limited editions, prices and my honest review."
>
  <Hero
    image={heroImg}
    eyebrow="Great spot · Osaka"
    title="Liberty Walk Osaka"
    subtitle="The small store of the cult widebody brand, not far from Dotonbori."
    focalPoint="58% 32%"
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pt-10 sm:pt-14 pb-8 sm:pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <a
      href={withBase("/en/osaka/")}
      class="link-underline reveal inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-ink-soft"
    >
      <Icon name="arrow-left" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      Back to Osaka
    </a>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 font-body text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Not far from Dotonbori, there's a small Liberty Walk store. The cult tuning brand sells its clothing there, the
      same you'll find in all its stores, but also Osaka limited editions. You'll also find accessories and scale
      models.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-xs text-mist-500">Not sponsored: I paid for my purchase myself.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-8 sm:pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">What I bought</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Personally, I couldn't resist a T-shirt with this design on the back. Count on about €50: it's expensive, sure,
      but the T-shirt is really good quality, and when you love something, you don't count the cost! It's not every day
      you get to go to Japan and treat yourself.
    </p>

    <Figure
      image={tshirtImg}
      alt="Liberty Walk “Slammed Works Style” design with the kanji for Osaka (大阪) and a light blue Nissan GT-R LB-Works, printed on the back of a black T-shirt"
      caption="The Osaka “Works Style” design, on the back of my T-shirt."
      class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-md"
    />

    <p class="reveal mt-8 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      I also brought home the scale model you can see at the top of this page: a Ferrari F40 in Liberty Walk colors.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-10 sm:pb-14 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">My verdict</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Given how big Osaka is, I expected a store as large as the one in Tokyo. In reality, as soon as you walk through
      the door, you're right in the middle of the store, and space is tight. If you've already been
      to <a href={withBase("/en/tokyo/")} class="link-underline font-medium text-racing-500">the Tokyo one</a>, unless
      you really want an Osaka edition, it isn't necessarily worth the detour.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-8 rounded-lg border border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/40 p-5">
      <p class="eyebrow text-racing-500">Store · Osaka</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Liberty Walk Osaka</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft">
        <li>Clothing, accessories and scale models</li>
        <li>Osaka limited editions</li>
        <li>T-shirt: about €50</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 flex items-start gap-1.5 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft">
        <Icon name="map-pin" class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
        {shopAddress}
      </p>
      <a
        href={mapsHref}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="link-underline mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
      >
        Open in Google Maps
        <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/50 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8">
      <a
        href={withBase("/en/osaka/")}
        class="link-underline reveal inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-ink"
      >
        <Icon name="arrow-left" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        Back to all Osaka spots
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
